                                                "sense_id": "fd364e2c-36f7-3484-9036-beec4b21b034",
                                                "text": "Liu's agents pursued him and he escaped assassination only by throwing his clothing away by the Chʻien-tʻang River near Hangchow, thus suggesting suicide."
